Bind Npc 24406 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14406 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 272 "Groom Hound Hunt"
    Journal for karus "[Imperial Guard] Bekar has commissioned you to hunt the Groom Hound. The Groom Hound can be found on the 5th Floor in Hell Abyss."
    Journal for elmorad "[Imperial Guard] Telson has commissioned you to hunt the Groom Hound. The Groom Hound can be found on the 5th Floor in Hell Abyss."
    Kill 20 of 3571 at direction_601

Requires player level >= 58

Rewards
    Give 35000000 experience

direction_601 = location "Gloom Hound" about "Gloom Hound\nMonsters summoned from Hell like the Hell Hounds, these guard the 5th floor of the Abyss of Hell." found "Abyss Dungeon" at 260 621 in zone 30

On available
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Telson is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "[Imperial Guard] Bekar will reward you when you complete the Groom Hound Hunt."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You may be able to gain valuable experience from this hunt. Why don't you and your colleagues come join us?"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Imperial Guard] Telson will reward you when you complete the Groom Hound Hunt."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You may be able to gain valuable experience from this hunt. Why don't you and your colleagues come join us?"

On in_progress
    Say "How's the hunt going? Experience doesn't always come easy. Cheer up!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_601

On ready
    Say "Whew... it's over!! That was one difficult hunt, wasn't it?"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Well done. Was it as hard as they say?"

On completed
    Say "Haha. Thank you!"
